npm create vite@latest .
Error: 
npm : File C:\Program Files\nodejs\npm.ps1 cannot be loaded because running scripts is disabled 
on this system. For more information, see about_Execution_Policies at 
https:/go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=135170.
At line:1 char:1
+ npm create vite@latest .
+ ~~~
    + CategoryInfo          : SecurityError: (:) [], PSSecurityException
    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : UnauthorizedAccess
Solution: Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned
        Then verify the change by running: Get-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser
        it should retun: RemoteSigned
select Framework: React
select Variant: JavaScript
